WEBVTT

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:08.040
<i>On that day 12 years ago,</i>

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:12.840
<i>an incredibly powerful bolt
of lightning suddenly descended</i>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:15.640
<i>from the Aurora Shell and struck
the old RUC headquarters.</i>

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:41.500
<i>That is the disaster
known as Blast Fall.</i>

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:52.020
<i>I lost my husband,
and he lost his daughter.</i>

00:00:54.390 --> 00:00:57.690
<i>Welcome to Maverick
Hunters Office!</i>

00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:00.790
<i>I am the president,
Miranda Maverick.</i>

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:03.630
<i>You can count on us
to do any kind of job.</i>

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:06.160
<i>From finding lost cats
to arresting criminals,</i>

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:07.970
<i>our skilled hunters
will resolve your problems.</i>

00:01:07.970 --> 00:01:10.140
<i>Impertinent little bitch.</i>

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:14.940
<i>- We'll need to teach her a lesson
in the etiquette of this world.
- Right now, we're doing
a special 20% off discount.</i>

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:15.540
<i>Hey.</i>

00:01:15.540 --> 00:01:18.270
<i>Please take this opportunity
to come pay us a visit sometime.</i>

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:24.120
<i>Thanks for ordering from us!</i>

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:27.290
<i>Welcome to Maverick
Hunters Office!</i>

00:01:27.290 --> 00:01:29.090
<i>I am the president,
Miranda Maverick.</i>

00:01:29.090 --> 00:01:31.920
<i>- Okay, I transferred it to your account.
- You can count on us to do any kind of job.</i>

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:34.730
<i>- Your reward of 850,000 traz.
- From finding lost cats
to arresting criminals,</i>

00:01:34.730 --> 00:01:36.630
<i>- Thank you for your hard work.
- our skilled hunters
will resolve your problems.</i>

00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:38.930
<i>- You look good on there.
- our skilled hunters
will resolve your problems.</i>

00:01:38.930 --> 00:01:40.270
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:01:40.270 --> 00:01:43.540
<i>- If another good job comes in, let me know.
- Right now, we're doing
a special 20% off discount.</i>

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:45.370
<i>- Of course.
- Right now, we're doing
a special 20% off discount.</i>

00:01:45.370 --> 00:01:48.810
<i>Please take this opportunity
to come pay us a visit sometime.</i>

00:01:48.810 --> 00:01:51.680
<i>We look forward to seeing you!</i>

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:54.350
<i>Well, what did you think?</i>

00:01:54.350 --> 00:01:55.880
<i>Today, we introduced...</i>

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:59.350
<i>Is this about yesterday's incident
with Dale Boyd and Grey Walker?</i>

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:00.320
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:03.490
<i>You sure are as
unpopular as ever.</i>

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:06.890
<i>All the other hunters got out of here
like you were the plague.</i>

00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:07.960
Kasha!

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:09.990
<i>But we operate
on the merit system.</i>

00:02:09.990 --> 00:02:13.000
<i>You're lucky Mom's
such a tolerant person.</i>

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:15.700
<i>I'm sorry about this.</i>

00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:16.830
<i>No worries.</i>

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:36.150
<i>Nee ima made shiritakatta
otogi-banashi no tsuzuki</i>

00:02:36.150 --> 00:02:44.330
<i>Eien ni owaranai
shiawase nara kono te de</i>

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:54.310
<i>Bokura wa marude ichimai-chigai
no guuzen o sagashiatte</i>

00:02:54.310 --> 00:02:56.470
<i>Meguriatta</i>

00:02:56.470 --> 00:03:04.550
<i>Kimi ga itsuka
nomikonda sono kotoba yori</i>

00:03:04.550 --> 00:03:13.490
<i>Zutto iezu ni
itekureteta yasashisa o</i>

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:20.470
<i>Shinjitai to ima omounda</i>

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:28.210
<i>Nee kono saki wa doko made mo
fuan to tonari-awase</i>

00:03:28.210 --> 00:03:34.610
<i>Nakusu mono ga nakatta
bokutachi wa mou inai</i>

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:42.320
<i>Nee ima made shiranakatta
otogi-banashi no tsuzuki</i>

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:48.490
<i>Eien ni owaranai
shiawase nara kono te de</i>

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:52.400
<i>Tsumikasanete
yuku mono</i>

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:03.030
<i>"A New Morning."</i>

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:07.110
<i>Hmm, I understand.</i>

00:04:07.110 --> 00:04:09.610
<i>So you, the president,
were the target of a sniper.</i>

00:04:09.610 --> 00:04:10.510
<i>Yes.</i>

00:04:10.510 --> 00:04:12.050
<i>I see.</i>

00:04:12.050 --> 00:04:16.050
<i>Don't just say, "I see!"
Act more concerned, damn it!</i>

00:04:16.050 --> 00:04:18.720
<i>Well, if you would like
to file a report on this,</i>

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:23.030
<i>please come to the station later
with your resident ID card.</i>

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:26.260
<i>Well, I will be going now.</i>

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:28.560
Wh-What was that?!

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:30.570
<i>He was totally useless!</i>

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:32.900
<i>That's about what you can
expect from the police.</i>

00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:34.470
<i>So, what do you want to do?</i>

00:04:34.470 --> 00:04:36.970
<i>Well...</i>

00:04:36.970 --> 00:04:39.910
<i>Could I ask you like always?</i>

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:41.410
<i>To be our bodyguard?</i>

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:43.010
<i>Sure.</i>

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:44.480
<i>It can't be helped.</i>

00:04:50.550 --> 00:04:52.790
<i>There's no sign
of any intruders.</i>

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:54.960
<i>Okay.
Thank goodness.</i>

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:55.760
<i>Do your best to...</i>

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:59.900
<i>"Do your best to keep the rooms dark
and don't stand by windows."</i>

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:00.900
Right?

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:01.930
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:05:01.930 --> 00:05:05.330
<i>It's so helpful that you live
in our apartment building.</i>

00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:08.500
<i>I'm going back to my place.
Call me if anything happens.</i>

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:09.940
<i>Good night.</i>

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:22.120
<i>Oh, that reminds me! We didn't check
with Roy on tomorrow's plans.</i>

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:23.590
<i>You're right.</i>

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:27.110
<i>Don't just say, "You're right!"
We have to go check with him!</i>

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:55.720
<i>You again...</i>

00:05:55.720 --> 00:05:57.590
<i>What?!
What was that sound?!</i>

00:05:57.590 --> 00:05:59.190
<i>Roy?!</i>

00:05:59.190 --> 00:06:00.420
Oh, my.

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:10.100
<i>My, my, my!
How cute!</i>

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:12.070
<i>So, who is she?</i>

00:06:12.070 --> 00:06:14.800
<i>- I don't know.
- She was in your room.</i>

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:16.470
<i>She's an unlawful intruder.</i>

00:06:16.470 --> 00:06:20.210
<i>But you had your head
bowed down to her.</i>

00:06:20.210 --> 00:06:23.210
<i>Say, what's your name?</i>

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:24.750
<i>Where are you from?</i>

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:26.270
<i>What about family?</i>

00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:31.120
<i>I do not know.</i>

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:34.660
<i>I do not know anything.</i>

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:36.730
<i>Never mind all that.
Hurry up and throw her out!</i>

00:06:36.730 --> 00:06:39.830
<i>We can't do that, Roy.
That's not nice.</i>

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:42.230
<i>Anyway, what's with these ears?</i>

00:06:42.230 --> 00:06:45.000
<i>Are resemble parts like this
popular right now?</i>

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:45.900
<i>No!</i>

00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:50.470
Wh-What?

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:55.180
<i>For the time being, how about
I let her stay at my place tonight?</i>

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:57.710
<i>I don't think
she's a bad person.</i>

00:06:57.710 --> 00:06:59.110
<i>You're okay with that?</i>

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:01.080
<i>Do what you want.</i>

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:02.570
<i>Isn't that great?</i>

00:07:39.420 --> 00:07:40.860
<i>Hey, Mom.</i>

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:42.520
What is it, Kasha?

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:46.530
<i>Do you really get it?
You're being targeted!</i>

00:07:46.530 --> 00:07:50.270
<i>So why are we going shopping
at a department store?</i>

00:07:50.270 --> 00:07:51.870
But...

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:55.600
<i>We usually keep a low profile
at home at times like this!</i>

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:59.640
<i>I feel bad for her
to be stuck with those clothes.</i>

00:07:59.640 --> 00:08:03.980
<i>Mine are too big for her
and yours are just too small.</i>

00:08:03.980 --> 00:08:05.980
<i>Well, that's true, but...</i>

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:07.180
<i>You're okay with this?</i>

00:08:07.180 --> 00:08:08.740
<i>Do what you want.</i>

00:08:14.060 --> 00:08:15.580
<i>We're going in!</i>

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:24.330
<i>I saw your commercial on TV.</i>

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:26.770
<i>You're far more
beautiful in real life!</i>

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:28.770
<i>Thank you so much.</i>

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:30.610
<i>Never mind that!
Clothes! Clothes!</i>

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:32.410
Oh, right.

00:08:32.410 --> 00:08:33.780
<i>Well, please excuse me now.</i>

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:36.270
<i>- Oh, that's too bad.
- I wanted to hear more about what you do.</i>

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:39.620
<i>How about something like this?</i>

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:41.850
<i>What? Isn't it childish?</i>

00:08:41.850 --> 00:08:43.220
<i>Then, how about this?</i>

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:45.820
<i>Too flashy.</i>

00:08:45.820 --> 00:08:46.560
<i>How about this?</i>

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:47.680
<i>Conservative!</i>

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:56.170
<i>Come on, which do you
think is cuter, Roy?</i>

00:08:56.170 --> 00:08:58.660
<i>Which one looks
better on her?</i>

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:04.510
<i>Don't ask me.</i>

00:09:04.510 --> 00:09:06.780
<i>Then what about between
this one and this one?</i>

00:09:06.780 --> 00:09:07.980
<i>Don't ask!</i>

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:09.510
<i>This or this?</i>

00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:11.580
<i>I don't know.</i>

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:15.150
<i>- Then how about something like this?
- Sure, that's good enough.</i>

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:17.550
What?! This?!

00:09:17.550 --> 00:09:19.590
This, huh?

00:09:19.590 --> 00:09:21.890
<i>Doesn't it look sort of tacky?</i>

00:09:21.890 --> 00:09:23.920
<i>And it's not very girlish...</i>

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:29.100
<i>This is fine.</i>

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:31.130
<i>I would like this.</i>

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:32.500
<i>Really?</i>

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:34.370
<i>If she says so herself...</i>

00:09:48.280 --> 00:09:51.220
<i>What's the big idea?</i>

00:09:51.220 --> 00:09:53.620
<i>Why did you come
to my place?</i>

00:09:55.020 --> 00:09:58.230
<i>I told you I don't have
time for you, remember?</i>

00:09:58.230 --> 00:10:00.430
U-Um...

00:10:00.430 --> 00:10:02.870
<i>I will cherish these clothes.</i>

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:05.930
<i>I will really cherish them.</i>

00:10:08.070 --> 00:10:10.270
<i>Hey, we bought food!</i>

00:10:10.270 --> 00:10:11.530
<i>Oh, okay!</i>

00:10:22.280 --> 00:10:25.620
<i>Are you having fun, Roy?</i>

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:27.090
<i>Oh, really?</i>

00:10:27.090 --> 00:10:30.460
<i>Stuff like this can be fun, too.
Don't you think?</i>

00:10:30.460 --> 00:10:34.830
<i>What?! You don't even know
how to eat a hamburger?!</i>

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:35.960
<i>No...</i>

00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:38.270
<i>Sheesh, you're hopeless.</i>

00:10:38.270 --> 00:10:41.800
<i>I'll teach you,
so watch carefully, okay?</i>

00:10:41.800 --> 00:10:43.770
<i>You squash it down
from the top like this,</i>

00:10:43.770 --> 00:10:45.670
<i>get a firm grip on it,</i>

00:10:45.670 --> 00:10:47.840
<i>open your mouth wide,
and like this...</i>

00:10:55.950 --> 00:11:00.060
<i>She's a sweet girl.</i>

00:11:00.060 --> 00:11:02.420
<i>Don't you think so?</i>

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:03.620
<i>I don't think so.</i>

00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:08.960
<i>What's with that?!
Your face looks so funny!</i>

00:11:16.270 --> 00:11:17.170
<i>Watch out!</i>

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:37.020
Damn it!

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:42.130
<i>Hey, are you okay?</i>

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:45.130
<i>She saved me...</i>

00:11:45.130 --> 00:11:47.000
<i>Hey... Hey!</i>

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:50.070
Ow, that hurt.

00:11:50.070 --> 00:11:50.940
Kasha!

00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:51.840
<i>Stay back!</i>

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:56.880
<i>Stay hidden.</i>

00:11:56.880 --> 00:11:58.550
<i>I understand.</i>

00:11:58.550 --> 00:11:59.480
<i>Where is he?</i>

00:12:02.020 --> 00:12:03.650
<i>Where is he shooting from?</i>

00:12:03.650 --> 00:12:04.950
<i>Over there.</i>

00:12:06.920 --> 00:12:09.160
Wha-?!

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:10.830
<i>That's impossible!</i>

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:14.230
<i>Is she a resemble?</i>

00:12:14.230 --> 00:12:17.900
<i>Oh, he has gone off somewhere.</i>

00:12:17.900 --> 00:12:18.800
Damn.

00:12:22.140 --> 00:12:23.240
<i>I've found her!</i>

00:12:23.240 --> 00:12:24.640
<i>Are you sure?</i>

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:27.140
<i>One of the images from the city's
anti-theft cameras</i>

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:29.480
<i>has come up as a hit
that appears to be our suspect.</i>

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:33.450
<i>The distinguishing characteristics
are an 89% match, huh?</i>

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:36.150
<i>She's got to be the one.</i>

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:37.450
<i>Let's go.</i>

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:44.160
<i>Hmm, is that so?</i>

00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:46.330
<i>You've been targeted
since yesterday?</i>

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:48.330
<i>I see.</i>

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:51.600
<i>So why is it that we keep getting
these unmotivated people?!</i>

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:53.570
<i>Calm down, Kasha.</i>

00:12:53.570 --> 00:12:57.670
<i>Oh, I've seen you
in a commercial.</i>

00:12:57.670 --> 00:12:58.840
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:03.680
<i>But why haven't you reported the fact
you're being targeted to the police?</i>

00:13:03.680 --> 00:13:05.750
<i>We reported it yesterday!</i>

00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:08.250
<i>There's no record of it, though.</i>

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:10.020
<i>We reported it
like we were supposed to!</i>

00:13:10.020 --> 00:13:12.750
<i>Darn it! Are you at all
serious about doing this?!</i>

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:14.810
<i>Calm down, Kasha.</i>

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:24.770
<i>Oh, you two, I'm questioning
some witnesses right now,</i>

00:13:24.770 --> 00:13:28.470
<i>so if you have business with these people,
could you wait outside?</i>

00:13:28.470 --> 00:13:32.010
<i>Oh, you're with the RUC's
Security Division!</i>

00:13:32.010 --> 00:13:34.440
<i>Now, you don't have to get
so formal with us.</i>

00:13:34.440 --> 00:13:37.580
<i>We just want a word
with one of them.</i>

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:42.050
<i>But these people's lives
are apparently being threatened</i>

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:45.190
<i>and it may be dangerous
for you as well.</i>

00:13:45.190 --> 00:13:47.490
<i>I believe there is no need
for such concern.</i>

00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:49.160
<i>Would you please
give us a moment?</i>

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:51.320
<i>Y-Yes, Ma'am.
Please excuse me.</i>

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:58.660
<i>We are Integra Martel and Silvia Ban
of the RUC's Security Division.</i>

00:14:00.800 --> 00:14:02.740
<i>Hold on!
What are you doing?!</i>

00:14:02.740 --> 00:14:07.210
<i>- What is this all of a sudden?!
- We have RUC security privileges.</i>

00:14:07.210 --> 00:14:09.310
<i>She is suspected of committing
industrial espionage</i>

00:14:09.310 --> 00:14:11.780
<i>and we will be taking her
to the RUC's Security Division.</i>

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:14.680
<i>Industrial espionage?!</i>

00:14:14.680 --> 00:14:15.620
<i>Excuse us.</i>

00:14:18.220 --> 00:14:19.990
<i>Please wait a minute!</i>

00:14:19.990 --> 00:14:22.790
<i>Won't you explain the situation
to us in more detail?</i>

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:27.030
<i>This is an image
of the suspect</i>

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:30.230
<i>who trespassed upon our
top secret sector the other day.</i>

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:38.470
<i>We tried to analyze the image
to narrow down our list of suspects,</i>

00:14:38.470 --> 00:14:41.640
<i>but we were unable to obtain
any substantial information</i>

00:14:41.640 --> 00:14:44.010
<i>from either the list of registered
residents or the list of criminals.</i>

00:14:44.010 --> 00:14:47.820
<i>Then, she's an unregistered resident...</i>

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:54.220
<i>But today, our search hit upon
this image of her at the department store.</i>

00:14:54.220 --> 00:14:55.890
<i>This is that image.</i>

00:14:55.890 --> 00:15:00.030
<i>Our current analysis
indicates an 89% match.</i>

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:04.200
<i>It is more than enough cause
for us to bring her in.</i>

00:15:04.200 --> 00:15:06.670
<i>Are you satisfied now?</i>

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:09.070
<i>Come on, let's go.</i>

00:15:09.070 --> 00:15:09.910
<i>Excuse me...</i>

00:15:09.910 --> 00:15:11.510
<i>Is there something more?</i>

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:13.710
<i>When did this happen?</i>

00:15:13.710 --> 00:15:16.140
<i>If you intend to prove
that she has an alibi,</i>

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:20.180
<i>it is useless,
Ms. Miranda Maverick.</i>

00:15:20.180 --> 00:15:26.690
<i>The result that RUC's computers
produced is proof enough.</i>

00:15:26.690 --> 00:15:27.810
<i>Mom...</i>

00:15:31.190 --> 00:15:33.130
<i>Mr. Roy...</i>

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:37.300
<i>Mr. Roy.</i>

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:42.470
<i>Please excuse us now.</i>

00:15:42.470 --> 00:15:43.470
<i>Let's go.</i>

00:15:43.470 --> 00:15:45.040
<i>N-No.</i>

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:45.910
<i>No.</i>

00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:47.380
<i>Come quietly!</i>

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:48.510
<i>I do not want to!</i>

00:15:48.510 --> 00:15:50.000
<i>You're coming with us!</i>

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:56.920
<i>What's the meaning of this?</i>

00:15:56.920 --> 00:16:00.690
<i>If you interfere, you may be
implicated as well.</i>

00:16:00.690 --> 00:16:04.190
<i>She's a girl!
Don't treat her so roughly!</i>

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:05.330
<i>Mr. Roy...</i>

00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:08.090
<i>Whatever! Let go
of my hand, Mister!</i>

00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:14.170
<i>Stop it!</i>

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:17.000
<i>Why you!</i>

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:23.980
<i>I could just as easily
punish you here and now!</i>

00:16:23.980 --> 00:16:25.540
<i>Stop this, Silvia.</i>

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:29.450
Wh-What's that?!

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:33.190
<i>Excuse me! A fire has broken out
on the third floor of this building!</i>

00:16:33.190 --> 00:16:35.120
<i>Please evacuate immediately!</i>

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:36.290
<i>A fire?!</i>

00:16:36.290 --> 00:16:37.760
<i>Please, hurry!</i>

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:40.630
Oh, that man...

00:16:40.630 --> 00:16:42.490
<i>He is the man
who shot at us!</i>

00:17:02.150 --> 00:17:03.120
<i>This girl...</i>

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:05.920
<i>She grabbed the bullet
with her bare hand?!</i>

00:17:11.190 --> 00:17:13.500
<i>This guy belongs
to Neumann & Co.</i>

00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:16.800
<i>You mean, another hunters
office was out to get Mom?</i>

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:18.930
<i>Yeah, that's what it
boils down to.</i>

00:17:30.050 --> 00:17:31.080
What?

00:17:31.080 --> 00:17:32.270
<i>I-It's not her!</i>

00:17:38.190 --> 00:17:38.990
What is it?

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:42.790
<i>Testing, testing. Emergency notice,
emergency notice.</i>

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:45.230
<i>As a result of a more minute
analysis of the image,</i>

00:17:45.230 --> 00:17:48.260
<i>there is no match between
the intruder and the suspect there.</i>

00:17:48.260 --> 00:17:54.470
<i>I repeat, there is no match
between the intruder and the suspect there.</i>

00:17:54.470 --> 00:17:57.740
<i>I'm punishing Accela
good right now.</i>

00:17:57.740 --> 00:18:00.780
<i>I-It wasn't me!
The system processed it wrong!</i>

00:18:00.780 --> 00:18:03.110
<i>I'm tripling your punishment
for complaining.</i>

00:18:03.110 --> 00:18:05.340
<i>That's so mean!</i>

00:18:06.010 --> 00:18:09.720
<i>Please pardon us.
Her guilt has been cleared.</i>

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:10.820
Huh?

00:18:10.820 --> 00:18:13.090
<i>What is that supposed to mean?</i>

00:18:13.090 --> 00:18:14.790
<i>It is exactly as I said.</i>

00:18:14.790 --> 00:18:18.730
<i>Well, we will be going now.</i>

00:18:18.730 --> 00:18:23.100
<i>It may not be my place to say this,
but that girl is an unregistered resident.</i>

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:25.870
<i>If you have no intention
of extending guardianship to her,</i>

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:30.410
<i>the law requires that unregistered residents
be turned over to the Protection Agency.</i>

00:18:30.410 --> 00:18:32.410
<i>What will it be?</i>

00:18:32.410 --> 00:18:35.280
But...

00:18:35.280 --> 00:18:36.440
<i>Roy.</i>

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:42.510
<i>What will it be?</i>

00:18:53.130 --> 00:18:56.300
<i>I have no intent
to be her guardian.</i>

00:18:56.300 --> 00:19:02.270
<i>Then I will have their agents
sent over as early as tomorrow.</i>

00:19:02.270 --> 00:19:03.570
<i>Roy!</i>

00:19:35.370 --> 00:19:39.340
Uh... Um...

00:19:39.340 --> 00:19:40.880
<i>What's wrong?</i>

00:19:40.880 --> 00:19:43.000
<i>Go back to Miranda's place
and go to sleep.</i>

00:19:51.950 --> 00:19:54.490
<i>Well, then, we at
the Protection Agency</i>

00:19:54.490 --> 00:19:56.730
<i>will take responsibility
of her care.</i>

00:19:56.730 --> 00:19:57.820
Right.

00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:02.600
<i>Come on, get in.</i>

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:17.880
That girl...

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:21.410
<i>She saved me...</i>

00:20:27.890 --> 00:20:28.880
<i>Roy.</i>

00:20:40.470 --> 00:20:41.640
<i>What in the- ?!</i>

00:20:41.640 --> 00:20:43.540
<i>That car is so dangerous!</i>

00:20:50.680 --> 00:20:52.170
<i>Now, hold on.</i>

00:20:54.650 --> 00:20:57.020
<i>Welcome back!</i>

00:20:57.020 --> 00:21:01.190
<i>I'll have you know, it's Miranda
that's going to take you in.</i>

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:03.290
<i>Yes. Yes!</i>

00:21:03.290 --> 00:21:04.460
<i>I hope we get along.</i>

00:21:04.460 --> 00:21:05.160
<i>Yes!</i>

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:07.860
<i>I'll have you know,
I'm the big sister here.</i>

00:21:07.860 --> 00:21:09.030
<i>Yes!</i>

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:12.870
<i>Then we should start
by deciding on her name.</i>

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:13.960
<i>Roy.</i>

00:21:19.070 --> 00:21:21.340
<i>Solty...</i>

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:22.480
<i>Solty?</i>

00:21:22.480 --> 00:21:24.310
<i>That sounds so random.</i>

00:21:24.310 --> 00:21:27.120
<i>I think it's good.
It's cute.</i>

00:21:27.120 --> 00:21:29.820
<i>Solty...</i>

00:21:29.820 --> 00:21:32.850
<i>Solty!</i>

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:34.550
<i>Yes!</i>

00:21:53.570 --> 00:21:58.340
<i>Hareta hi no kouen</i>

00:21:58.340 --> 00:22:01.280
<i>Miageta sora ni</i>

00:22:01.280 --> 00:22:12.560
<i>Kiesou ni natta chiisana
Little Cloud</i>

00:22:12.560 --> 00:22:17.330
<i>Kaze ni mi o makasete</i>

00:22:17.330 --> 00:22:20.270
<i>Jiyuu ni ikiru</i>

00:22:20.270 --> 00:22:28.310
<i>Sukoshi-zutsu
aruku watashi-tachi</i>

00:22:28.310 --> 00:22:33.080
<i>Onnaji dane</i>

00:22:33.080 --> 00:22:37.820
<i>Taisetsu na jikan</i>

00:22:37.820 --> 00:22:41.650
<i>Deau tabi ni</i>

00:22:41.650 --> 00:22:51.200
<i>Hitori ja nai kono kimochi
yasashisa ni naru</i>

00:22:51.200 --> 00:22:57.770
<i>Dareka o shinjiru
yuuki ni kaete</i>

00:22:57.770 --> 00:23:10.110
<i>Kitto kono mama ano sora
no hate ni kieru mae ni</i>

00:23:16.860 --> 00:23:19.420
<i>My precious first day.</i>

00:23:19.420 --> 00:23:22.930
<i>And the day I met you.</i>

00:23:22.930 --> 00:23:25.260
<i>Next time, "Girl In Blue".</i>

00:23:25.260 --> 00:23:27.290
<i>Who are you?</i>
